">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0d7040 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0d7040\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"524\">A import\u00e2ncia da prepara\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica<\/h6><p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"709\">O sucesso desportivo n\u00e3o se constr\u00f3i apenas dentro das quatro linhas. A excel\u00eancia da prepara\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica e da recupera\u00e7\u00e3o dos atletas tem um papel determinante no rendimento em campo.<\/p><p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"1049\">Neste contexto, destacamos o trabalho de <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"801\">Ant\u00f3nio Gaspar \u2013 Physio Therapy &amp; Performance<\/strong>, nosso cliente e refer\u00eancia nacional e internacional na \u00e1rea da fisioterapia e performance. O contributo da sua equipa tem sido essencial para garantir que os jogadores chegam ao mais alto n\u00edvel competitivo, preparados para superar cada desafio.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70e1e00 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"70e1e00\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a8a77b elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4a8a77b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2b4095 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c2b4095\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1c970c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a1c970c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1080\">Orgulho e reconhecimento<\/h6><p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1390\">Para a Devlop, \u00e9 um privil\u00e9gio acompanhar de perto o trabalho de profissionais que est\u00e3o no centro da recupera\u00e7\u00e3o e da performance da nossa Sele\u00e7\u00e3o. Esta vit\u00f3ria \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m um reconhecimento do valor de todos os que apoiam diariamente os atletas, permitindo que o talento portugu\u00eas brilhe no maior dos palcos.<\/p><p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1424\"><strong data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1415\">Parab\u00e9ns, Portugal!<\/strong> \ud83c\udfc6\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Portugal conquista a UEFA Nations League pela segunda vez! \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9\u26bd A Sele\u00e7\u00e3o Nacional voltou a fazer hist\u00f3ria ao conquistar, pela segunda vez, a UEFA Nations League. Este triunfo \u00e9 o reflexo do talento, da dedica\u00e7\u00e3o e do esp\u00edrito de equipa que caracterizam jogadores, equipa t\u00e9cnica e todos os profissionais que trabalham nos bastidores do futebol [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":17256,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[88],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17214"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=17214"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17214\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":17260,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17214\/revisions\/17260"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/17256"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=17214"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=17214"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=17214"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}